", "id": "3641550656146307", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_3641550659479640_8867883677995369303_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zBq4hI9qKuUQ7kNvwE2yIi8&_nc_oc=AdqaEGeRo0-UWwEeIkdSRTeLttZfijLa4Aty8Whnp-5shrq5b0383xAuY4fwVXbLCoI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLJR4mKvCFW-LTkVknz0Bo2AuGv9HcDY0iG8R4lmWF7yw&oe=6AA7FD1E"}, {"file_name": "screenshot.png", "id": "606329465659295", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_606329468992628_8346371957676797649_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uuoS3j1eK5YQ7kNvwE6jxcD&_nc_oc=AdpDrIrsIX-0Naum2WVTHdb6F-9lbxH4W3QfWSzSSoXCw9_NeXGdKMz83Y70vegliTo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK5vj-Ebah-2DcHpzogRULG0SmQIE0XrHVwqPGtYahBsw&oe=6AA7E313"}, {"file_name": "screenshot1.png", "id": "1460316745170605", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617847_1460316748503938_3292300042834351776_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1u-rPDgKXE4Q7kNvwFneX9a&_nc_oc=Ado_sc-ax2pY6_2uUshbmNne9Non4RUVPDNbCvMKX_139fQtuOCoHb7VCF3CajWNJNY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK5Kfe9W1nk1dah_37sx1l807xbFxpUMc45RnhoNF0BZw&oe=6AA7E6D6"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "1455540008824715", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618440_1455540012158048_1649248167125430766_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sE03U_lxS2oQ7kNvwHwwaht&_nc_oc=Adpom6Y7hi3nO5y_uMc5TEzuwMgISXyNfHadqB9AstknXckGuwA9p0UdVc7GNmrsM8A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLQ0w1cuVd7a8dlTTX0ole1q5WdElXol8q08lS8Dhl8fA&oe=6AA7FBD3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "4038756736363000", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_4038756739696333_2834424856108332602_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HJ0j0vxKZiYQ7kNvwHihxTK&_nc_oc=AdrrvI1YSYY4AkhJuwrYfHaV3IcnV065zlbMZwS4pKeDo7vI57TRPDfBGtEa4yB42q8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIzUs4iZPgc_jekjKhK40ZeCUoZdQgoFdcmdx9YhCk0ug&oe=6AA815FB"}, "display_name": "The Endless Drive", "keywords": ["Survival", "Car", "Action", "Driving", "Zombie"], "long_description": "**SURVIVE THE APOCALYPSE ON FOUR WHEELS!\ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8**\n\nGrab the wheel and drive to survive in the ultimate post-apocalyptic road trip. This is your story. Your journey. Your rules of survival.\n## **\ud83e\udd1d TEAM UP OR GO SOLO**\n\n Survive with friends in up to 4-player co-op, or brave the desolate roads alone. When you're solo, all the loot is yours, but so are all the dangers. The choice is yours.\n## **\ud83d\udd27 BUILD YOUR ROLLING FORTRESS**\n\n Your car is more than a vehicle\u2014it's your lifeline. Scavenge for parts, bolt on armor, mount powerful weapons, and turn your ride into a zombie-shredding machine.\n## **\u2694\ufe0f FIGHT THE DEAD AND THE LIVING**\n\n The undead are predictable, but the living are far more dangerous. Battle relentless zombie hordes and outsmart cunning human gangs who want your car, your supplies, and your life.\n## **\ud83d\udca5 CREATE YOUR OWN MAYHEM**\n\n This world is your chaotic playground. Use physics to your advantage\u2014send zombies flying with a reinforced bumper, or create explosive traps for unsuspecting gangs. If you can see it, you can probably break it.\n## **\ud83c\udf54 SURVIVE BEYOND THE BASICS**\n\n This isn't just about fighting. Scavenge for food and water, and yes, even find a safe place to answer nature's call. Neglect your needs, and become just another corpse on the road.\n", "short_description": "Grab the wheel, trust your friends, and survive the apocalypse together. Your ultimate road trip through a world of zombies and gangs begins now! "}]}, "developer_name": "Storay Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com